            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>System for adhesive bonding of substrates. The system comprises: applying a layer of adhesive (1) on a first substrate and/or on a second substrate; and positioning the first substrate on the second substrate, with interposition of the applied adhesive layer (1). The system comprises, before positioning the first substrate on the second substrate, postforming at least one strip of the first substrate on at least one contour of the second substrate, perform the adaptation of the strip to the specific geometry of the at least one contour of the second substrate, and applying radiation curing means (13) on the adhesive layer (1) in order to partially cure said adhesive layer (1) in a selected manner.</p>
            </abstract>
